firebase_auth_secure_storage_dart
Copyright 2026 Razvan Lung (long1eu) and contributors.

This package implements the AuthStorage interface of firebase_auth_providers_dart
on top of the secret stores of the operating system (the macOS Keychain through
Security.framework, libsecret on Linux, DPAPI on Windows), called through
dart:ffi. It copies no code of another project.

